{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "d4393750-3044-8e9e-af5f-f5b8f665f381",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:41:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sarah E. Kim",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation department, this is Beth. Good morning, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, hi, good morning! My name is Sarah Kim. I'm calling for my mother, she walks the dog at the beach every day. Sorry, I have a baking show on in the background, it's very distracting. Let me turn it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. What are you wondering about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, do dogs have to be on a leash at the beach in winter? She says no one is there, so it's fine, but I told her to ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good thing you called. Generally, yes, keep the dog leashed. The off-season rules can be different from summer, but a leash is the safe bet. Also, after last weekend's nor'easter, some beach areas may have debris or washed-out spots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. Washed-out, that means the sand is gone in places?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, eroded, or lots of seaweed and rocks pushed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is there a web page with the same information? Then I can show her, she likes to see it written."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:12-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the city website has a recreation section with the beach and park rules. Look under parks and beaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful, I'll find it. Thank you so much, Beth. Bye!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, have a great day!"
    }
  ],
